{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/extras/cca356510b82e188836cdff6c3d68cc5.poster.avif?t=1767862388\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/extras/cca356510b82e188836cdff6c3d68cc5.mp4?t=1767862388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Marcel on his journey toward the Waterfall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Master Pepper, dash from place to place as you try to find your way. Overcome challenges alongside Marcel and immerse yourself in a unique story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>fallsaga</i>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky and memorable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make important choices that shape the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that occasionally block your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the enemies that stand in your way. (Or don\u2019t. It\u2019s up to you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a nostalgic journey through pixel art visuals and chiptune music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a powerful and emotional narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the one-eyebrowed cat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallsaga is a narrative-driven game built around dialogues and story. Interacting with characters is the core mechanic. Your choices in conversations will influence how the story unfolds \u2014 and even alter the outcomes of smaller events. Sometimes, a single choice may determine someone\u2019s fate. Marcel\u2019s relationships with other characters are shaped by your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy puzzles that range from simple to thought-provoking. And puzzles aren\u2019t the only thing blocking Marcel\u2019s path \u2014 confront the people trying to stop him, and shape their fate as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO IS FALLSAGA FOR?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that focus on storytelling and dialogue \u2014 where your choices shape the direction of the narrative \u2014 then fallsaga is just right for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like mysterious moments that make you wonder what's really happening behind the scenes, fallsaga will keep you intrigued throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While experiencing the story, you'll also get to enjoy the atmosphere through occasional puzzles and action sequences that keep things engaging and prevent monotony.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814160?t=1767862388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/e1917f5e48dae6b0bc56e1c45c13300afa7151c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767862388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/a47e2dba19faa7c7fe8037d49408ce91ec488881/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767862388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/a47e2dba19faa7c7fe8037d49408ce91ec488881/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767862388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/extras/cca356510b82e188836cdff6c3d68cc5.poster.avif?t=1767862388\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/extras/cca356510b82e188836cdff6c3d68cc5.mp4?t=1767862388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Marcel on his journey toward the Waterfall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Master Pepper, dash from place to place as you try to find your way. Overcome challenges alongside Marcel and immerse yourself in a unique story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>fallsaga</i>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky and memorable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make important choices that shape the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that occasionally block your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the enemies that stand in your way. (Or don\u2019t. It\u2019s up to you.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a nostalgic journey through pixel art visuals and chiptune music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness a powerful and emotional narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the one-eyebrowed cat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallsaga is a narrative-driven game built around dialogues and story. Interacting with characters is the core mechanic. Your choices in conversations will influence how the story unfolds \u2014 and even alter the outcomes of smaller events. Sometimes, a single choice may determine someone\u2019s fate. Marcel\u2019s relationships with other characters are shaped by your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy puzzles that range from simple to thought-provoking. And puzzles aren\u2019t the only thing blocking Marcel\u2019s path \u2014 confront the people trying to stop him, and shape their fate as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO IS FALLSAGA FOR?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games that focus on storytelling and dialogue \u2014 where your choices shape the direction of the narrative \u2014 then fallsaga is just right for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like mysterious moments that make you wonder what's really happening behind the scenes, fallsaga will keep you intrigued throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While experiencing the story, you'll also get to enjoy the atmosphere through occasional puzzles and action sequences that keep things engaging and prevent monotony.</p>","developers":["lyzerfiction"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814160/6172929944a82f8cedf6d9d4d20b657a2d9e5b3c/header.jpg?t=1767862388","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814160/509486287/1a9b3f714d8e665e7a0d674ba2d8b3b70dfed200/1759106076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760618896","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814160/509486287/1a9b3f714d8e665e7a0d674ba2d8b3b70dfed200/1759106076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760618896","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814160/509486287/1a9b3f714d8e665e7a0d674ba2d8b3b70dfed200/1759106076/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760618896","id":257188425,"name":"FALLSAGA Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188425/22526a730d42f6e21dc2f5714163303dc1dbfb32/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760618896"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814160/1871848552/9d0344b2ed67820ad8843eefad72b163adeac66f/1752761373/dash_av1.mpd